WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Despite its filename, this is a sealed-asset portal CLI fixture.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
narrator: It depends on the configured public devnet RPC and demo Circle.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
narrator: Probe local portal health and read the fixture's Circle ID.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:29.000
narrator: Request opening index.html with the demonstration passphrase.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:42.000
narrator: Fetch CSS with response headers.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:54.000
narrator: Fetch JSON with the same configured passphrase.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:10.000
narrator: Write the binary asset and inspect the local file size.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:19.000
narrator: Commands can mask errors; inspect their output before assuming success.
